{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../auth_schemes/client_assertion/", "title": "Client Assertion"}, "next": {"link": "../store/abstract/", "title": "Abstract"}, "title": "Auth Types", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"module-auth_types\">\n<span id=\"auth-types\"></span><h1>Auth Types<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-auth_types\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Type definitions for auth0-server-python SDK.\nThese Pydantic models provide type safety and validation for all SDK data structures.</p>\n<section id=\"attributes\">\n<h2>Attributes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#attributes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.ChallengeType\" title=\"auth_types.ChallengeType\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChallengeType</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.EnrollAuthenticatorOptions\" title=\"auth_types.EnrollAuthenticatorOptions\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">EnrollAuthenticatorOptions</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.EnrollmentResponse\" title=\"auth_types.EnrollmentResponse\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">EnrollmentResponse</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.EnrollmentType\" title=\"auth_types.EnrollmentType\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">EnrollmentType</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.OobChannel\" title=\"auth_types.OobChannel\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">OobChannel</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.PASSWORDLESS_ALLOWED_AUTH_PARAMS\" title=\"auth_types.PASSWORDLESS_ALLOWED_AUTH_PARAMS\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PASSWORDLESS_ALLOWED_AUTH_PARAMS</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.PASSWORDLESS_RESERVED_AUTH_PARAMS\" title=\"auth_types.PASSWORDLESS_RESERVED_AUTH_PARAMS\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PASSWORDLESS_RESERVED_AUTH_PARAMS</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.PasswordlessConnection\" title=\"auth_types.PasswordlessConnection\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PasswordlessConnection</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.PreferredAuthMethod\" title=\"auth_types.PreferredAuthMethod\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PreferredAuthMethod</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.SESSION_EXPIRY_MAX_PLAUSIBLE\" title=\"auth_types.SESSION_EXPIRY_MAX_PLAUSIBLE\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">SESSION_EXPIRY_MAX_PLAUSIBLE</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.StartPasswordlessOptions\" title=\"auth_types.StartPasswordlessOptions\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StartPasswordlessOptions</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.VerifyMfaOptions\" title=\"auth_types.VerifyMfaOptions\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">VerifyMfaOptions</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section id=\"classes\">\n<h2>Classes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#classes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.AccessTokenForConnectionOptions\" title=\"auth_types.AccessTokenForConnectionOptions\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AccessTokenForConnectionOptions</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Options for retrieving an access token for a specific connection.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.AnonymousCreateTokenResponse\" title=\"auth_types.AnonymousCreateTokenResponse\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AnonymousCreateTokenResponse</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Raw response from POST /anonymous/token on the create path.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.AnonymousSession\" title=\"auth_types.AnonymousSession\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AnonymousSession</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Public result of create_session() and the renewal ladder.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.AnonymousSessionContext\" title=\"auth_types.AnonymousSessionContext\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AnonymousSessionContext</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Internal context stored inside the encrypted anonymous session record, rejecting extra fields so a tampered payload raises on decrypt.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.AnonymousSessionData\" title=\"auth_types.AnonymousSessionData\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AnonymousSessionData</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Identity and metadata fields returned by AnonymousClient.get_session(), with no session_token.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.AnonymousTokenResponse\" title=\"auth_types.AnonymousTokenResponse\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AnonymousTokenResponse</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Raw response from POST /anonymous/token.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.AnonymousTokenSetEntry\" title=\"auth_types.AnonymousTokenSetEntry\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AnonymousTokenSetEntry</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>One cached access token for a specific audience/scope pair.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.AnonymousTransferTokenResponse\" title=\"auth_types.AnonymousTransferTokenResponse\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AnonymousTransferTokenResponse</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Raw response from POST /anonymous/token on the transfer-ticket path.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.AuthenticationMethod\" title=\"auth_types.AuthenticationMethod\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AuthenticationMethod</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.AuthenticatorResponse\" title=\"auth_types.AuthenticatorResponse\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AuthenticatorResponse</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Represents an MFA authenticator enrolled by a user.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.AuthorizationDetails\" title=\"auth_types.AuthorizationDetails\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AuthorizationDetails</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Authorization details returned from Auth0.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.AuthorizationParameters\" title=\"auth_types.AuthorizationParameters\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AuthorizationParameters</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Parameters used in authorization requests.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.ChallengeOptions\" title=\"auth_types.ChallengeOptions\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChallengeOptions</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Options for initiating an MFA challenge.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.ChallengeResponse\" title=\"auth_types.ChallengeResponse\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChallengeResponse</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Response from initiating an MFA challenge.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.CompleteConnectAccountRequest\" title=\"auth_types.CompleteConnectAccountRequest\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CompleteConnectAccountRequest</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.CompleteConnectAccountResponse\" title=\"auth_types.CompleteConnectAccountResponse\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CompleteConnectAccountResponse</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.ConnectAccountOptions\" title=\"auth_types.ConnectAccountOptions\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ConnectAccountOptions</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.ConnectAccountRequest\" title=\"auth_types.ConnectAccountRequest\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ConnectAccountRequest</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.ConnectAccountResponse\" title=\"auth_types.ConnectAccountResponse\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ConnectAccountResponse</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.ConnectParams\" title=\"auth_types.ConnectParams\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ConnectParams</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.ConnectedAccount\" title=\"auth_types.ConnectedAccount\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ConnectedAccount</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.ConnectedAccountBase\" title=\"auth_types.ConnectedAccountBase\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ConnectedAccountBase</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.ConnectedAccountConnection\" title=\"auth_types.ConnectedAccountConnection\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ConnectedAccountConnection</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.ConnectionTokenSet\" title=\"auth_types.ConnectionTokenSet\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ConnectionTokenSet</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Token set specific to a connection.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.CreateAnonymousSessionOptions\" title=\"auth_types.CreateAnonymousSessionOptions\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CreateAnonymousSessionOptions</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Options bundle for create_session(), carrying audience, scope, and metadata.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.CustomTokenExchangeOptions\" title=\"auth_types.CustomTokenExchangeOptions\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CustomTokenExchangeOptions</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Options for custom token exchange (RFC 8693).</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.DomainResolverContext\" title=\"auth_types.DomainResolverContext\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DomainResolverContext</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Context passed to domain resolver function for MCD support.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.EncryptedStoreOptions\" title=\"auth_types.EncryptedStoreOptions\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">EncryptedStoreOptions</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Options for encrypted stores.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.EnrollAuthenticationMethodRequest\" title=\"auth_types.EnrollAuthenticationMethodRequest\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">EnrollAuthenticationMethodRequest</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.EnrollEmailOptions\" title=\"auth_types.EnrollEmailOptions\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">EnrollEmailOptions</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Options for enrolling an email authenticator.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.EnrollOobOptions\" title=\"auth_types.EnrollOobOptions\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">EnrollOobOptions</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Options for enrolling an OOB authenticator (SMS, Voice, Push).</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.EnrollOtpOptions\" title=\"auth_types.EnrollOtpOptions\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">EnrollOtpOptions</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Options for enrolling an OTP authenticator.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.EnrollmentChallengeResponse\" title=\"auth_types.EnrollmentChallengeResponse\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">EnrollmentChallengeResponse</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.Factor\" title=\"auth_types.Factor\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Factor</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.GetFactorsResponse\" title=\"auth_types.GetFactorsResponse\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">GetFactorsResponse</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.InternalStateData\" title=\"auth_types.InternalStateData\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">InternalStateData</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Internal data used for managing state.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.ListAuthenticationMethodsResponse\" title=\"auth_types.ListAuthenticationMethodsResponse\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ListAuthenticationMethodsResponse</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.ListAuthenticatorsOptions\" title=\"auth_types.ListAuthenticatorsOptions\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ListAuthenticatorsOptions</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Options for listing MFA authenticators.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.ListConnectedAccountConnectionsResponse\" title=\"auth_types.ListConnectedAccountConnectionsResponse\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ListConnectedAccountConnectionsResponse</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.ListConnectedAccountsResponse\" title=\"auth_types.ListConnectedAccountsResponse\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ListConnectedAccountsResponse</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.LoginBackchannelOptions\" title=\"auth_types.LoginBackchannelOptions\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">LoginBackchannelOptions</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Options for Client-Initiated Backchannel Authentication.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.LoginBackchannelResult\" title=\"auth_types.LoginBackchannelResult\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">LoginBackchannelResult</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Result from Client-Initiated Backchannel Authentication.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.LoginWithCustomTokenExchangeOptions\" title=\"auth_types.LoginWithCustomTokenExchangeOptions\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">LoginWithCustomTokenExchangeOptions</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Options for logging in via custom token exchange.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.LoginWithCustomTokenExchangeResult\" title=\"auth_types.LoginWithCustomTokenExchangeResult\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">LoginWithCustomTokenExchangeResult</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Result from login with custom token exchange.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.LogoutOptions\" title=\"auth_types.LogoutOptions\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">LogoutOptions</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Options for logout operations.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.LogoutTokenClaims\" title=\"auth_types.LogoutTokenClaims\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">LogoutTokenClaims</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Claims expected in a logout token.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.MfaRequirement\" title=\"auth_types.MfaRequirement\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaRequirement</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>A single MFA requirement entry.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.MfaRequirements\" title=\"auth_types.MfaRequirements\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaRequirements</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>MFA requirements from an mfa_required error response.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.MfaTokenContext\" title=\"auth_types.MfaTokenContext\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaTokenContext</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Internal context stored inside encrypted mfa_token.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.MfaVerifyResponse\" title=\"auth_types.MfaVerifyResponse\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaVerifyResponse</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Response from MFA verification.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.OobEnrollmentResponse\" title=\"auth_types.OobEnrollmentResponse\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">OobEnrollmentResponse</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Response when enrolling an OOB authenticator.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.OtpEnrollmentResponse\" title=\"auth_types.OtpEnrollmentResponse\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">OtpEnrollmentResponse</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Response when enrolling an OTP authenticator.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.PasskeyAuthResponse\" title=\"auth_types.PasskeyAuthResponse\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PasskeyAuthResponse</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.PasskeyAuthenticatorSelection\" title=\"auth_types.PasskeyAuthenticatorSelection\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PasskeyAuthenticatorSelection</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.PasskeyLoginChallengeResponse\" title=\"auth_types.PasskeyLoginChallengeResponse\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PasskeyLoginChallengeResponse</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.PasskeyLoginResult\" title=\"auth_types.PasskeyLoginResult\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PasskeyLoginResult</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Result from signin_with_passkey.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.PasskeyPubKeyCredParam\" title=\"auth_types.PasskeyPubKeyCredParam\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PasskeyPubKeyCredParam</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.PasskeyPublicKeyOptions\" title=\"auth_types.PasskeyPublicKeyOptions\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PasskeyPublicKeyOptions</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.PasskeyRpInfo\" title=\"auth_types.PasskeyRpInfo\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PasskeyRpInfo</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.PasskeySignupChallengeResponse\" title=\"auth_types.PasskeySignupChallengeResponse\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PasskeySignupChallengeResponse</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>!!! abstract &quot;Usage Documentation&quot;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_types.PasskeyTokenResponse\" title=\"auth_types.PasskeyTokenResponse\"><code class=\